Tab/Shift+Tab changes field; arrows/Home/End move the rune cursor; Enter inserts
 a literal newline.[K
Ctrl+V reveals/masks this buffer only. F1 opens this help; Esc returns without c
hanging the buffer.[K
Ctrl+S previews, then submits after the complete preview is reviewed with PgDn.[K
Esc in the form offers Keep in memory, Discard, or Return. Reopen the same inten
t to resume.[K
Ctrl+C warns before quitting: all active and kept drafts are lost when this proc
ess exits.[K
Submitted requests freeze. Ctrl+R retries only the identical payload and request
 ID, never automatically.[K
Ctrl+L rechecks original identity without sending or changing the buffer. Change
d authority fails closed.[K
A receipt reports server-supported delivery state, not proof of execution or wak
e.[K
